rgetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n50" value="Thứ tự BẮT BUỘC của đề ảnh: check room → pay Deposit → SUCCESS mới create Reservation → save bằng ReservationRepository → Room=Booked. Payment Failure / Occupied: không tạo Reservation, không đổi Room thành Booked. Giả định PaymentService nhận receipt rồi lưu Deposit cùng Reservation trong một transaction (composition); cần timeout/refund/rollback ngoài phạm vi đề nếu lỗi lưu sau khi đã thu tiền." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=14;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff8df;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="2320" width="2020" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="third" name="Q3 StayEase Activity"><mxGraphModel dx="1422" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="2380"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;StayEase · Q3 Check-out and Inspection · Activity Level 2 – Design&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=14;spacing=8;fillColor=#efecfc;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="1640" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="System / CheckoutService" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=14;spacing=8;swimlane;startSize=20;html=1;startSize=45;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="520" height="2050" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="Host" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=14;spacing=8;swimlane;startSize=20;html=1;startSize=45;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="110" width="520" height="2050" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="Guest (Customer)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wra